	(text "Controls and display. Four B10K pots on the Alchemist grid: Mix, Sustain, Strings (row +38) and Jawari (0, +13), across +3V3, wipers to ADC1 PA0, PA1, PA2, PA4 through 1k / 100n.\nThree Taiway 100-DP6 ON-ON-ON toggles, as The Alchemist: Tuning (-20, +13), Brightness (+20, +13), Retune (0, -5). Commons (2, 5) to GND, pins 3 and 4 to two MCU inputs with internal pull-ups: up = A low B high, centre = both low, down = A high B low.\nDisplay: a thin 0.91 in 128x32 SSD1306 OLED strip on I2C1 (PB6 SCL, PB7 SDA), 4.7k pull-ups to +3V3, behind a window at face Y -18. J408 is the module connector (GND, +3V3, SCL, SDA)."
